Origins
-------

OrbVis is an independent reimplementation of the visualisation
concepts originally introduced by NagVis (https://www.nagvis.org/) — a
PHP-based map tool for Nagios / Icinga / Checkmk released by the NagVis
Project under GPL-2.0-only. OrbVis does not contain NagVis source code;
the .cfg import format is the only NagVis artefact OrbVis interoperates
with, and even that is parsed without copying NagVis parser code.

OrbVis links optionally against Checkmk (https://checkmk.com/) when
running inside an OMD site. It uses Checkmk's Livestatus protocol and
its htpasswd / auth-cookie formats. Checkmk is licensed under
GPL-2.0-only (Raw edition) plus commercial licenses for the
Enterprise / Cloud editions; OrbVis bundles no Checkmk source.

Third-party software
--------------------

OrbVis ships with — or installs at runtime — a number of open-source
dependencies, each under its own license. Generated SBOMs (one per
release) are attached to GitHub release artefacts:

  * Backend (Python):   sbom-backend-X.Y.Z.cdx.json   (CycloneDX)
  * Frontend (Node.js): sbom-frontend-X.Y.Z.cdx.json  (CycloneDX)

To regenerate the SBOMs locally:

    # Backend
    cd backend
    pip install cyclonedx-bom
    cyclonedx-py environment --output-file sbom-backend.cdx.json

    # Frontend
    cd frontend
    npm sbom --sbom-format cyclonedx > sbom-frontend.cdx.json

